    "about_sections_faq_title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "about_sections_faq_description": "Grand Tale is a high-fantasy social life-sim game which hosts sub-games of multiple genres. The game is set in a world where players can explore, create, and explore their own worlds. The game is a living, breathing world that respects your time and intelligence.",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_general_title": "General",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_general_q1_question": "What is Grand Tale?",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_general_q1_answer": "Grand Tale is a high-fantasy social life-sim game which hosts sub-games of multiple genres. The game is set in a world where players can explore, create, and explore their own worlds. The game is a living, breathing world that respects your time and intelligence.",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_general_q2_question": "When will Grand Tale be released?",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_general_q2_answer": "Grand Tale is currently in active development. Stay tuned to our news section for release date announcements.",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_general_q3_question": "On which platforms will Grand Tale be available?",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_general_q3_answer": "We are targeting a multi-platform release including PC and major consoles.",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_gameplay_title": "Gameplay",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_gameplay_q1_question": "What can I do in Grand Tale?",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_gameplay_q1_answer": "You can explore a vast open world, engage in various sub-games across different genres, build your own home, and socialize with players worldwide.",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_gameplay_q2_question": "Is there a multiplayer mode?",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_gameplay_q2_answer": "Yes! Grand Tale is a social experience at its core, featuring persistent multiplayer environments and collaborative activities.",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_gameplay_q3_question": "Can I customize my character?",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_gameplay_q3_answer": "Extensively. Our deep character creator allows you to define your look, while our progression system lets you define your playstyle.",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_technical_title": "Technical",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_technical_q1_question": "What are the system requirements?",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_technical_q1_answer": "System requirements will be finalized closer to release. We aim to support a wide range of hardware.",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_technical_q2_question": "Does Grand Tale support controllers?",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_technical_q2_answer": "Yes, Grand Tale will feature full controller support on all platforms.",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_technical_q3_question": "How do I report a bug?",
    "about_sections_faq_groups_technical_q3_answer": "During our testing phases, you can report bugs through our official discord or the support section of our website.",
    "about_sections_faq_footer": "Have a question that isn't covered in this FAQ? Check out our {link}.",
